+         * nothing to unwind but the armed-and-unstarted buffer, which is the
+         * well-defined case.  Declining costs little: an endpoint that has
+         * already transferred data is by definition not NAK-starved, and its
+         * completion path (xfer_complete_isr with is_more) picks up the next
